        "PMC9692591::web::023::3_3_thermal_stability_and_high_temperatu"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "Comparable Al-, Mn-, and Si-containing alloys can be tested at 900 °C for 24 hours, with oxide thickness, phase, adhesion, spallation, and mass gain used as discriminating measurements.",
